Footer copyright year was hardcoded to 2024, causing it to become outdated.

## Changes

- Replace hardcoded year with `new Date().getFullYear()` in Footer component
- Use `useState` + `useEffect` pattern to handle Next.js SSR without prerender errors
- Add `suppressHydrationWarning` to prevent hydration mismatch warnings

## Implementation

```tsx
const [currentYear, setCurrentYear] = useState(2024);

useEffect(() => {
  setCurrentYear(new Date().getFullYear());
}, []);

return (
  <p className="text-muted">
    © <span suppressHydrationWarning>{currentYear}</span> Mustofa Amami. {t("rights-reserved")}
  </p>
);
```

Initial state prevents build-time prerendering errors. Client-side effect updates to actual year after hydration.

